<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY LEAGUE-BRITAIN DRAW TOUR OPENER IN NEW ZEALAND.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-BRITAIN DRAW TOUR OPENER IN NEW ZEALAND.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain drew 22-22 with the Lion</p>
<p>Red Cup XIII after trailing 14-10 at halftime in the opening</p>
<p>game of their New Zealand rugby league tour on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Lion Red Cup XIII - Tries: Tukere Barlow, Jonathan Hughes,</p>
<p>Gus Malietoa-Brown. Goals: Ben Lythe (5)</p>
<p>Britain - Tries: Anthony Sullivan, Stuart Spruce, Keiron</p>
<p>Cunningham, Daryl Powell. Goals: Iestyn Harris (3)</p>
